  "description": "Find the minimum moves to make all pairs sum to the same value T, where each number 1 <= nums[i] <= limit.",
  "target": "T = 4",
  "pseudocode": "1. delta = [0] * (2 * limit + 2)\n2. for i in range(n/2):\n3.   a, b = nums[i], nums[n-1-i]\n4.   delta[2] += 2\n5.   delta[min(a,b) + 1] -= 1\n6.   delta[a + b] -= 1\n7.   delta[a + b + 1] += 1\n8.   delta[max(a,b) + limit + 1] += 1",
